    "chunk_text": "her beforan. Ab hora III usque nonam non est bona luna sanguinem minuere fram undertid o\u00f0 non nys na god Luna XXVII; puer natus prudens mona se seofonandtwenti, cild acenned snoter. Puella honesta, sapiens m\u00e6den wyr\u00f0ful, wis. Eger uiuet seoc leofa\u00f0. Somnia habent effectum; nichil nocebunt swefenu habba\u00f0 gefremmincge; naht na deria\u00f0. Tota die bona luna sanguinem minuere ealne d\u00e6g god mona blod latan. Luna XXVIII; puer natus laboriosus, in omnibus credulus mona se eahtaandtwenti; cild accenned Puella obediens, fidelis m\u00e6den gehyrsum, getriwe. Eger cito ualet seoc ra\u00f0e gee\u00fera\u00f0. Somnia ut supra swefnu swa her beforan. Ab hora nona usque sero bona luna sanguinem minuere fram nontidi o\u00f0 \u00e6fen god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna XXIX; puer natus credulus & eminens mona se nigonandtwenti, cild acenned geleafful & rice. Puella sapiens & diues m\u00e6den wis & w\u00e6lig. Somnium bonum & certum swefnu god & gewiss. Similiter bona luna sanguinem minuere ealswa god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna XXX; puer natus felicissimus, benignus mona se \u00feritti; cild acenned ges\u00e6ligust, milde. Puella felix, mansueta m\u00e6den ges\u00e6lig, ge\u00few\u00e6re. Eger laborat, sed uiuet seoc swin\u00f0 ac he leofa\u00f0. Somnia infra triduum reuelabuntur; interdum cauendum est swefnu binnon \u00ferim dagum beo\u00f0 Non est bona luna sanguinem minuere na god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Fini",
